Check input results that glibc fortification marks warn_unused_result, and
drop a dead variable that GCC 16 reports, so the build keeps -Werror and
_FORTIFY_SOURCE.  Short save-file reads take the existing corrupt-save path
(mh_ReLoad returns 1); failed fgets ends the INI and character-dump loops or
takes MEMWATCH's abort answer.  Nix channel maintenance patch, applied after
the three Guix channel patches.

